<section class="staticPage">
	<p>This site SourceLead.com (hereinafter known as “SourceLead”) is owned and operated by Businessintelli Solutions, Inc. ("Businessintelli Solutions "). Businessintelli Solutions recognizes that your privacy is important and we are committed to safeguarding the privacy of our users while providing network services. Supplying personally identifiable information is entirely voluntary and solely at your discretion. You are not required to register with us in order to use our sites. However, we offer some services only to visitors who do register. Please read the following to learn more about our privacy policy.</p>
    <p>By accessing SourceLead you agree to the collection and use of your data by SourceLead in the manner provided in this Privacy Policy.</p>
    <h4>What this Privacy Policy Covers</h4>
    <p>This Privacy Policy covers SourceLead’s treatment of information that SourceLead collects when you are on the SourceLead, and when you use SourceLead. This policy also covers SourceLead's treatment of personally identifiable and other information that SourceLead's business partners share with SourceLead. The Policy does not apply to the procedures and practices followed by entities that are not managed, owned or controlled by SourceLead or to the people that are not engaged, employed or managed by SourceLead.</p>
    <p>SourceLead is not responsible for the accuracy, completeness, veracity and reliability of any advertising and contents, products and services which may be accessed or advertised to you and SourceLead will not be liable for any loss or damage arising out of the same.</p>
    <h4>Information Collection and Use </h4>
    <p>SourceLead collects personally identifiable information when you register at SourceLead, when you use SourceLead’s products or services, when you visit SourceLead’s pages, and when you enter promotions or sweepstakes. SourceLead may also receive personally identifiable information from our business partners.</p>
    <p>When you register with SourceLead, we may ask for your name, email address, birth date, gender, contact number, education, zip code, occupation, industry, professional and personal interests. Once you register with SourceLead and sign in to our services, you are not anonymous to us. SourceLead also automatically receives and collects certain anonymous information on our server logs from your browser including your IP address, SourceLead cookie information and the page you requested. SourceLead may also collect the following information about the pages you visit/access, the links you click on our site, the number of times you access the page.</p>
    <p>In addition, when you use the site to post jobs, projects, submissions, any other user generated content on this site, you should be aware that any personally identifiable information you submit there can be read, collected, or used by other users of the site. You agree that if you post personal information online that is accessible to the public, you may receive unsolicited messages from other parties in return and that SourceLead will not be responsible for the use or misuse of such information.</p>
    <p>No information may be submitted by persons under the age of 18 without the consent of a parent or legal guardian, nor may persons under the age of 18 make purchases or other legal acts on SourceLead without such consent. SourceLead encourages all parents or guardians to instruct their children in the safe and responsible use of their Personal Information while using the Internet. SourceLead will not knowingly collect or use any Personal Information collected from children for any purpose whatsoever, including disclosure to third parties.</p>
    <p>When you visit the Site, whether as a registered user or a non-registered user just browsing the Site (any of these, a “SourceLead User”), our servers automatically record information that your browser sends whenever you visit a website (“Log Data”). This Log Data may include information such as your computer’s Internet Protocol (“IP”) address, browser type, browser software version or the webpage you were visiting before you came to our Site, pages of our Site that you visit, the time spent on those pages, information you search for on our Site, access times and dates, and other statistics. In addition, we may use third party services such as Google Analytics that collect, monitor and analyze this type of information in order to increase our Site’s functionality and user-friendliness, to better tailor it to our visitors’ needs, and to detect suspicious activity. We do not treat Log Data as Personal Information, but we may use it in association with Personal Information, and we may aggregate, analyze and evaluate such Log Data for the same purposes as stated above regarding other Non-Identifying Information.</p>
    <p>Like many websites, we use “cookies” to collect information. A cookie is a small data file that we transfer to your computer’s hard disk for record-keeping purposes. We use cookies for two purposes. First, we utilize persistent cookies to save your registration ID and login password for future logins to the Site and to track your compliance with our network policies. Second, we utilize session ID cookies to enable certain features of the Site, to better understand how you interact with the Site and to monitor aggregate usage by SourceLead Users and web traffic routing on the Site. Unlike persistent cookies, session cookies are deleted from your computer when you log off from the Site and Service and then close your browser. You can instruct your browser, by changing its options, to stop accepting cookies or to prompt you before accepting a cookie from the websites you visit. If you do not accept cookies, however, you may not be able to use all portions of the Site or all functionality of the Service.</p>
    
    <h4>Use of Information</h4>
    <p>SourceLead uses information to authenticate your identity as per the regulations, provide personalized features, to get in touch with you in the case of password retrieval, to preserve social history as may be required by existing laws in India, to customize the advertising and content you see, to fulfill your requests for certain products and services promoted by SourceLead or other companies, and to contact you about specials and new products. We also use information internally to direct our efforts for product improvement, contact you as a survey respondent and send you promotional Material / Services from our contest sponsors or advertisers. Some of our advertisers may collect anonymous traffic information from their own assigned cookies to your browser. We have no access or control over such cookies. SourceLead will not sell or rent your personally identifiable information to anyone.</p>
    <p>SourceLead will not use your financial information for any purpose other than to complete a transaction with you.</p>
    <p>SourceLead will not send personally identifiable information about you to other companies or people only when we have your permission, to provide products or services you've requested.</p>
    <p>We reserve the right to disclose your personally identifiable and email address information as required by law and when we believe that disclosure is necessary to protect our rights and/or comply with a judicial proceeding, court order, or legal process served on our SourceLead.</p>
    <p>We share your information with advertisers on an aggregate basis only.</p>
    <h4>Security</h4>
    <p>No method of transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage, is 100% secure, however. Therefore, while we strive to safeguard the confidentiality of your personally identifiable information, transmissions made by means of the Internet cannot be made absolutely secure. By using this site, you agree that we will have no liability for disclosure of your information due to errors in transmission or unauthorized acts of third parties.</p>
    <h4>Changes to Privacy Policy</h4>
    <p>SourceLead may amend Privacy Policy from time to time. Your continued use of SourceLead means that you accept any new or modified terms and conditions that we come up with. Please re-visit the ‘Privacy Policy’ link at our site from time to time to stay abreast of any changes that we may introduce.</p>
